<title>USA: Damen Financial sets share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Damen Financial sets share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>SCHAUMBURG, Ill. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Damen Financial Corp said Tuesday it plans to repurchase up to five percent of its outstanding shares in the open market.</p>
<p>The shares will be purchased at prevailing market prices from time to time over a six-month period, depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>Damen Financial, the holding company for Damen National Bnak, has 3,246,720 shares outstanding currently.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
